OL,3,GNEWSACouncil renews deal at
OL,4,A'cockroach-infested' flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies will continue to be sent to
OL,7,Flive in a former office block once
OL,8,Fdescribed as "cockroach-infested" and
OL,9,Fcondemned by housing charities as
OL,10,Funsuitable.
OL,12,FBristol City Council has renewed its
OL,13,Fagreement with landlord Caridon to
OL,14,Fprovide temporary accommodation at
OL,15,FImperial Apartments in Hartcliffe for
OL,16,Fanother five years.
OL,18,FEarlier this year, residents reported
OL,19,Fcockroach infestations and issues with
OL,20,Fraw sewage filling their baths and
OL,21,Fsinks.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
