OL,3,GNEWSACouncil renews deal at
OL,4,A'cockroach-infested' flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Barry Parsons, chair of the
OL,7,Fhousing committee, said: "We're working
OL,8,Freally closely with Caridon to resolve
OL,9,Fthose issues and we've seen a big
OL,10,Freduction in the number of complaints
OL,11,Fthere."
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
